  "description": "A hardcore tech pack, that started back in 1.5.2, that caters to a lot of everything; tech, magic, PVP, non-PVP, and community. The mod pack contains a selection of mods, especially tech mods, to allow multiple production paths and systems to be used at once and in ever-changing ways.  Be warned the pack contains GTCE and while it is not set up to be a pure GTCE environment, many of the GT recipes are active. Configs have been tweaked to stay true to previous versions of the pack.  Like \"Reality\", \"Digital Reality\", should have a little bit of everything to be complete and have multiple ways to achieve your goals.",
